@startuml
title Inventory Management System

[*] --> State

state "Add Goods" as AddGoods
state "Update Price" as UpdatePrice
state "Remove Goods" as RemoveGoods
state "Notify Removal" as NotifyRemoval
state "Place Order" as PlaceOrder
state "Generate Invoice" as GenerateInvoice
state "Search Items" as SearchItems
state "Calculate Discount" as CalculateDiscount
state "Generate Receipt" as GenerateReceipt
state "Replace Item" as ReplaceItem
state "Cancel Receipt" as CancelReceipt
state "Record Request" as RecordRequest
state "View Summary Report" as ViewSummaryReport

AddGoods --> UpdatePrice : add goods
UpdatePrice --> RemoveGoods : update price
RemoveGoods --> NotifyRemoval : remove goods
NotifyRemoval --> PlaceOrder : notify removal
PlaceOrder --> GenerateInvoice : place order
GenerateInvoice --> SearchItems : generate invoice
SearchItems --> CalculateDiscount : search items
CalculateDiscount --> GenerateReceipt : calculate discount
GenerateReceipt --> ReplaceItem : generate receipt
ReplaceItem --> CancelReceipt : replace item
CancelReceipt --> RecordRequest : cancel receipt
RecordRequest --> ViewSummaryReport : record request
ViewSummaryReport --> [*]

@enduml
